{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01TLYRmdVQaneKF7ipRDXHZx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Completed **Q31: Lost in the middle / context pollution** (`02-031-lost-in-the-middle-context-pollution.md`).\n\n**What the note covers:**\n- **Concept:** Liu et al. 2023's U-shaped positional attention bias — accuracy drops from ~70% → ~45% when the answer document is in the middle of a 20-doc context\n- **Context pollution:** how bumping top-k from 3→10 floods the prompt with marginally relevant, contradictory chunks\n- **Diagnostic split:** if RAGAS `context_recall` is high but `faithfulness` is falling → generation-over-noisy-context failure, not a retrieval bug\n- **Mitigations:** cross-encoder reranking to k=3–5; sandwich placement (top chunk first/last); cosine threshold gating; LLMLingua 3–5× compression\n- **Key pitfall:** saying \"use a bigger context window\" — the U-shaped bias persists at longer lengths and a wider window makes pollution worse\n\n**3 remaining tasks in Next:** Q32, Q33, Q34, then validate."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":88,"cache_read_input_tokens":61561,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":88,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ecd3a3e-f73d-4634-a656-eb312015b68a","uuid":"872d7719-9257-4bd1-a3d3-78ff4464f944"}
